{"strongs": "H1576", "word": "גְּמוּל", "translit": "ge.mul", "root": "גמד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "dealing, recompence, benefit", "definition": "גְּמוּל noun masculine dealing, recompence, benefit — ׳ ג Ps 94:2 + 11 t.; suffix גְּמֻלְךָ Obad 1:15 , etc.; plural suffix גְּמוּלָיו Ps 103:2 — 1. גְּמוּל יָדַיִם dealing of the hands Judg 9:16 ; Prov 12:14 ( יָשׁוּב לְ ) Isa 3:11 ( יֵעָשֶׂה לְ ). 2. dealing , hence (from context) equivalent of dealing, recompence: with suffix Obad 1:15 גמלך ישׁוב בראשׁך , Joel 4:4 ; Joel 4:7 ( הֵשִׁיב ), so with הֵשִׁיב לְ Ps 28:4 שִׁלֵּם לְ Ps 137:8 ; Prov 19:17 absolutely גְּמוּל לְ ( הֵשִׁיב ) שִׁלֵם Isa 59:18 (twice in verse); Isa 66:6 ; Jer 51:6 ; Lam 3:64 עַל Joel 4:4 ; Ps 94:2 ; Isa 35:4 ׳ ג אלהים the recompence of God. 3. benefit: אַל תשׁכחי כל גמוליו Ps 103:2 כגמול עליו according to the benefit (done) unto him 2Chr 32:25", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1680')\">BDB1680</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1576')\">H1576</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1679')\">BDB1679</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1681')\">BDB1681</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גְּמוּל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>dealing, recompence, benefit</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 94:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,2)\">Ps 94:2</ref> + 11 t.; suffix <bdbheb>גְּמֻלְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Obad 1:15\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,15)\">Obad 1:15</ref>, etc.; plural suffix <bdbheb>גְּמוּלָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 103:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,2)\">Ps 103:2</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>גְּמוּל יָדַיִם</bdbheb> <highlight>dealing of the hands</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,16)\">Judg 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,14)\">Prov 12:14</ref> (<bdbheb>יָשׁוּב לְ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 3:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,11)\">Isa 3:11</ref> (<bdbheb>יֵעָשֶׂה לְ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>dealing</highlight>, hence (from context) <highlight>equivalent of dealing, recompence:</highlight> with suffix <ref ref=\"Obad 1:15\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,15)\">Obad 1:15</ref> <bdbheb>גמלך ישׁוב בראשׁך</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Joel 4:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,4)\">Joel 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 4:7\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,7)\">Joel 4:7</ref> (<bdbheb>הֵשִׁיב</bdbheb>), so with <bdbheb>הֵשִׁיב לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,4)\">Ps 28:4</ref> <bdbheb>שִׁלֵּם לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 137:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"137\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"137\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,137,8)\">Ps 137:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 19:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,17)\">Prov 19:17</ref> absolutely <bdbheb>גְּמוּל לְ</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>הֵשִׁיב</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>שִׁלֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 59:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,18)\">Isa 59:18</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 66:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,6)\">Isa 66:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,6)\">Jer 51:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:64\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"64\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"64\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,64)\">Lam 3:64</ref> <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 4:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,4)\">Joel 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 94:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,2)\">Ps 94:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 35:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,4)\">Isa 35:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ג</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אלהים</bdbheb> <highlight>the recompence of God.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>benefit:</highlight> <bdbheb>אַל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תשׁכחי כל גמוליו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 103:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,2)\">Ps 103:2</ref> <bdbheb>כגמול עליו</bdbheb> <highlight>according to the benefit</highlight> (done) <highlight>unto him</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,25)\">2Chr 32:25</ref> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 94:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 94, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Obad 1:15", "book": "OBA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 103:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 103, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Judg 9:16", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Prov 12:14", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 3:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Joel 4:4", "book": "JOL", "chapter": 4, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Joel 4:7", "book": "JOL", "chapter": 4, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 28:4", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ps 137:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 137, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Prov 19:17", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 19, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 59:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 59, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 66:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 66, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Jer 51:6", "book": "JER", "chapter": 51, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Lam 3:64", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 64}, {"raw": "Isa 35:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 35, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "2Chr 32:2